00:07:33.753 --> 00:07:35.354
that just hits differently.

00:07:35.354 --> 00:07:36.489
And I think it's going to be tougher,

00:07:36.489 --> 00:07:37.089
you know?

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:37.790
Go ahead.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:38.624
No, I just

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:40.193
I mean, I think a

